src/shell.html
This project bundles an interactive HTML shell originally produced as
part of AIAPIChannel/aac-core PR #99 (`spec/templates/html-shell.html`).
The shell is a self-contained markdown rendering harness using
github-markdown-css, highlight.js, and Mermaid via CDN, with custom
client-side JavaScript for auto-enhancement (TOC, anchors, search,
code copy, etc.).
